==English==

===Etymology===
From ''to [[spill]]'', [[the]]'', and ''[[bean]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/spɪl ðə biːn/|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[spill]] [[the]] [[beans]]|spills the beans|spilling the beans|spilled the beans}}

# {{context|idiomatic|intransitive|lang=en}} To [[reveal]] a [[secret]]; to [[disclose]].
#: ''They had planned it as a surprise party, but somebody '''spilled the beans'''.''

====Synonyms====
* to [[squeak]]

